    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214730/extras/12f5559cdbd4cd1fb213fb512564214d.avif?t=1736671235\" width=616 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Universe of Trials</strong> is a fast-paced multiplayer climbing game that tests your skill across a variety of exciting game modes. Race against friends in increasingly challenging environments, each filled with unique obstacles and no checkpoints. Every mode offers a fresh challenge\u2014whether it's the classic climb, surviving in &quot;Floor is Lava,&quot; avoiding disappearing platforms in &quot;Falling Floor,&quot; or outlasting everyone in &quot;Last to Leave.&quot; Every fall demands quick reflexes and sharp strategy as you push for victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214730/extras/7f4951a169eee7f94d6adc8cf7026571.poster.avif?t=1736671235\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214730/extras/7f4951a169eee7f94d6adc8cf7026571.webm?t=1736671235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214730/extras/7f4951a169eee7f94d6adc8cf7026571.mp4?t=1736671235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Competition:</strong> Challenge friends or players worldwide in various high-stakes modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Game Modes:</strong> From classic races to &quot;Floor is Lava,&quot; &quot;Falling Floor,&quot; and &quot;Last to Leave,&quot; each mode keeps the gameplay fresh.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Environments:</strong> Climb through diverse levels with unique themes and hazards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill-Based Gameplay:</strong> Master precise movements and strategies to overcome obstacles and opponents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Checkpoints:</strong> Every fall tests your resolve in this high-intensity climb.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Controls:</strong> Easy to pick up, challenging to master, perfect for casual and competitive play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboards:</strong> Track your progress and compete for the top spot across multiple modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to conquer the &quot;Universe of Trials&quot;? Rise above the competition and claim your victory!</strong></p>",
